omes with expected completion in May 2028. Tower C adds 701 homes, larger 775 to 1,324 sq ft plans and an October 2030 expected completion. Treat the price, plan and delivery date by tower.\n\n### Inside the project\n\n  * Towers A/B: 1,604 homes · 721–1,076 sq ft · May 2028\n  * Tower C: 701 homes · 775–1,324 sq ft · October 2030\n  * Two to four-bedroom choices\n  * Selected Tower C plans are dual-key ready\n\n### Location & access\n\n  * Inside the Sunway Velocity integrated development\n  * Connected to Sunway Velocity Mall\n  * Access to nearby MRT and LRT stations\n  * One station from TRX\n\n### Facilities\n\n  * Direct mall link and nearby healthcare\n  * MRT and LRT access in the wider development\n  * Digital lock and selected co-living-ready features\n  * Ask for the exact tower facility and maintenance schedule\n\nBUYER ANALYSIS\n\n## How to assess this project.\n\n### Towers A and B are not Tower C\n\nTowers A and B publish 1,604 homes, 721 to 1,076 sq ft layouts and expected completion in May 2028. Tower C is a newer 701-home release with 775 to 1,324 sq ft layouts and expected completion in October 2030. Match every price and plan to the correct release.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSunway Velocity 3 Review 2026: Which Tower Fits? (https://klcc-residences.my/reviews/sunway-velocity-3-review)\nciteturn290search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Image: Sunway Velocity 3 exterior ... Tower C is a later 701-home release with 775–1,324 sq ft layouts and expected completion in October 2030.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nKLCC New Launches Completing in 2027, 2028, 2029 and Later (https://klcc-residences.my/buy/klcc-new-launches-completing-2027-2028-2029)\nciteturn290search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; CloutHaus, Pavilion Square, Royal Lexis and Armani Hallson publish 2029 targets, while KL360 and Sunway Velocity 3 Tower C extend into 2030. ... Co